---
import FarmLayout from '../../layouts/FarmLayout.astro';
---

<FarmLayout
  title="How Pre-Order Farm Delivery Works | Farm Direct Gwalior"
  description="Learn about our consolidated agricultural transport model bringing raw seasonal produce directly from village farms to Gwalior neighbourhoods."
  canonicalPath="/farm/how-it-works"
>
  <div class="fd-container py-8 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      <!-- Title -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#275629] font-bold bg-[#eaf3e9] px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Agricultural Logistics Model
        </span>
        <h1 class="fd-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#152317] mt-3">
          How Pre-Order Works
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#536354] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Why we operate on a pre-order and scheduled neighbourhood delivery model instead of instant delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Principle Card -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#e0e8dc] shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#152317]">
          The Consolidated Harvest Journey
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#415343] leading-relaxed">
          Traditional supermarkets and quick-commerce services store grains in intermediary warehouses for months, often treating them with preservatives to extend shelf life. We do things differently.
        </p>

        <!-- Visual Flow -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#f8faf6] border border-[#e5ede2] my-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-3 text-center text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#dce6d8]">
              <div class="text-2xl mb-1">🏡</div>
              <strong class="text-[#152317] block">1. Village Farm</strong>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#536354]">Harvest & sun-dry</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center text-[#275629] font-bold text-lg">&rarr;</div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#dce6d8]">
              <div class="text-2xl mb-1">📋</div>
              <strong class="text-[#152317] block">2. Neighbourhood Pre-Orders</strong>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#536354]">Pawan Nagar & Chetakpuri</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center text-[#275629] font-bold text-lg">&rarr;</div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#dce6d8]">
              <div class="text-2xl mb-1">🚛</div>
              <strong class="text-[#152317] block">3. Bulk Consolidated Trip</strong>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#536354]">Scheduled vehicle to Gwalior</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#415343] leading-relaxed">
          By grouping customer pre-orders into weekly clusters, we minimize vehicle trips, eliminate artificial storage chemicals, and supply you with produce straight from the current harvest.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Step Detailed Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="fd-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#152317]">Step-by-Step Experience</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e0e8dc] flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#275629] text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">1</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-[#152317]">Select Current Harvest Produce</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#536354] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Choose from raw wheat, whole groundnuts, desi chana, moong, urad, and seasonal farm cuttings. The stock you see on the website represents actual kilograms stored at the farm.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e0e8dc] flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#275629] text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">2</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-[#152317]">Place a Pre-Order Online (or via WhatsApp)</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#536354] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Add items to your cart, pick your neighbourhood cluster, and enter your delivery address. No upfront payment is required—you pay upon delivery.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e0e8dc] flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#275629] text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">3</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-[#152317]">Order Consolidation</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#536354] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Orders for the same delivery day are assembled at the farm, weighed into eco-friendly bags, and packed for transport into Gwalior.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e0e8dc] flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#275629] text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">4</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-[#152317]">Scheduled Neighbourhood Delivery</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#536354] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Our farm vehicle visits your colony on the scheduled delivery round. You inspect your raw produce and pay by cash or UPI.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Footer -->
      <div class="bg-[#f0f4ee] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#dce6d8] text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="fd-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#152317]">Ready to order fresh harvest produce?</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#536354] max-w-md mx-auto">
          Explore this week's produce or request a 100g/200g free sample if you'd like to check quality first.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="/farm/products" class="fd-btn fd-btn-primary px-6 py-3 font-bold text-sm">
            View Produce Catalogue &rarr;
          </a>
          <a href="/farm/samples" class="fd-btn fd-btn-secondary px-5 py-3 font-bold text-sm">
            Request Free Sample
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</FarmLayout>
